  "question": "An artificial satellite of mass $m$ is revolving around in a circular orbit of radius $r$. If the mass of the earth is $M$, the angular momentum of the satellite with respect to the centre of the earth is",
  "diagram": "",
  "diagram_alt": "",
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "$\\sqrt{GMm^2r}$",
      "image": ""
    },
